{
    "$schema": "https://go.kicad.org/pcm/schemas/v2",
    "identifier": "com.github.alphaseneca.kiforge",
    "type": "plugin",
    "name": "KiForge",
    "description": "Export Gerbers, BOM, CPL, STEP, 3D, SVG, PDF, and HTML BOM from KiCad 10 in one click.",
    "description_full": "KiForge is a KiCad 10 manufacturing and documentation exporter.\n\nRun from the PCB editor (Tools > External Plugins > KiForge) or headless via CLI and GitHub Actions. One export produces versioned outputs including:\n- Gerber and drill archive\n- Raw KiCad and optional JLCPCB-formatted BOM and placement CSVs\n- Schematic PDF, STEP model, 3D renders, and copper SVGs\n- Interactive HTML BOM (uses InteractiveHtmlBom when available; pip install attempted if missing)\n\nJLCPCB CSV formatting prepares files for manual upload. KiForge does not connect to any fabrication or ordering API.\n\nRequires KiCad 10.0 or later on Windows, macOS, or Linux.\n\nDocumentation: https://github.com/alphaseneca/kiforge/blob/main/USAGE.md\nReport issues: https://github.com/alphaseneca/kiforge/issues",
    "category": "manufacturing",
    "tags": [
        "export",
        "manufacturing",
        "bom",
        "gerber"
    ],
